01:02:07.840 --> 01:02:11.460
so it's really, so you observe...

01:02:11.460 --> 01:02:14.000
So, you know, it's not complete.

01:02:14.000 --> 01:02:16.250
So there's this huge world outside,

01:02:16.250 --> 01:02:18.620
